    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_statement">Strata Launcher collects no data. It has no internet access, no analytics, no ads and no accounts. Your settings, themes and app history are stored only on this phone and, if you turn it on, in your own Android backup. Notification contents, contact data and searches are never stored.</string>
